    <ol class="journey-legs">
        <li data-leg-note="0"><strong>First journey</strong> <span class="meta">(Acts 13 to 14)</span><br />Acts says the church at Antioch sent Barnabas and Paul to Cyprus and then inland to cities in what is now Turkey.</li>
        <li data-leg-note="1"><strong>Second journey</strong> <span class="meta">(Acts 15:36 to 18:22)</span><br />Acts says Paul crossed into Macedonia and Greece, reaching Philippi, Thessalonica, Athens and Corinth.</li>
        <li data-leg-note="2"><strong>Third journey</strong> <span class="meta">(Acts 18:23 to 21:17)</span><br />Acts says Paul spent a long period in Ephesus, revisited Macedonia and Greece, and returned to Jerusalem.</li>
        <li data-leg-note="3"><strong>Voyage to Rome</strong> <span class="meta">(Acts 27 to 28)</span><br />Acts says Paul was taken to Rome as a prisoner, and describes a storm and a shipwreck on Malta along the way.</li>
    </ol>
  </div>
  <p class="meta">
    Schematic illustration, not to scale. Coastlines are simplified and city positions are approximate. Routes are
    simplified from the account in Acts; Paul's own letters mention some of these places and give a different outline.
    Dates are not shown because they are debated.
  </p>
</section>

<style>
  .journey {
    margin-block: 2.5rem;
  }
  .journey-map {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    display: block;
    border: 1px solid var(--rule);
    border-radius: 0.75rem;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .journey-map .land {
    fill: var(--card);
  }
  .journey-map .sea {
    fill: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 16%, var(--bg));
    stroke: var(--rule);
    stroke-width: 1;
  }
  .journey-map .route {
    fill: none;
    stroke: var(--accent);
    stroke-width: 2.5;
    stroke-linecap: round;
    stroke-linejoin: round;
    stroke-dasharray: 1 0;
  }
  .journey-map .city circle {
    fill: var(--bg);
    stroke: var(--accent);
    stroke-width: 2.5;
  }
  .journey-map .city text {
    fill: var(--fg);
    font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;
    font-size: 13px;
    paint-order: stroke;
    stroke: var(--card);
    stroke-width: 3px;
  }
  .journey-legs {
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }
  .journey-legs li {
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }
</style>

<script>
  import '../scripts/journey';
</script>
